; KammHorizontal_10mmInletLines_0p5mmGap_10PlatformPlus129ChannelLayers
; Added four 10 mm horizontal inlet-alignment roads per platform layer (40 total).
; Per-layer order: original left, lower/upper left roads, original right, lower/upper right roads.
; Left roads print left-to-right; right roads are the exact mirror (right-to-left).
; Original channel-stage text is unchanged. Adaptive mesh expanded for new footprint.
; KammInletAssembly_10PlatformPlus129ChannelLayers_Aligned1p84000x1p96165
; P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG
; PLATFORM layers 1-10: exact executable copy of KammInletPlatform_Mirrored_10Layers_Start2mm_End1p5mm_Gap2p09904mm.gcode
; CHANNEL source layers 1-129 are offset upward 0.60 mm; physical global layers 11-139
; Left/right channel layers are interleaved at each height; final model height 8.34 mm
; Lower inlet-circle center from bottom inlet platform reference: X +1.84000 mm, Y +1.96165 mm
; Reference left vertical X124.420016; bottom horizontal Y114.710299; right placement mirrors center about X128
; Normal channel paths/settings retained; source layer 7 detached loop replaced by wall-attached wave bands
; Channel settings: 245 C nozzle, 70 C bed, K0.05, source flow 0.98 already included in E
; Source channel first layer 3 mm/s; subsequent layers 5 mm/s; platform settings do not carry over
; No repeated channel startup, calibration, homing, purge or shutdown between components
; Transition wait parked at X20 Y220 Z5; no bed-temperature wait or heating above 70 C
; Repaired wave: walls first, 3 overlapping bands at 2 mm/s, fan255, about 0.164 mm lateral steps
; Static verification only; physical printing remains unverified
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
